he's calling us dogs.

164
00:13:28,375 --> 00:13:31,278
Okay, little puppy,
you looked in a mirror lately?

165
00:13:31,311 --> 00:13:33,546
Now, go get somebody
their slippers or something.

166
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:36,049
