but looks like somebody

172
00:13:51,664 --> 00:13:53,666
already did us the favor, eh?

173
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:56,069
So in lieu of that...

174
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:03,676
Dippity doo dang, babe.

175
00:14:14,955 --> 00:14:17,424
Hey, man,
close the damn door!

176
