for Samurai Jack.

179
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,607
Huh, what'd you say?

180
00:14:34,641 --> 00:14:37,244
I'm looking
for Samurai Jack.

181
00:14:37,277 --> 00:14:38,511
