for the samurai?!

185
00:14:53,994 --> 00:14:58,865
Little girl, Samurai Jack is
the toughest S.O.B. out there.

186
00:14:58,898 --> 00:15:02,202
Last time we fought,
he did...

187
00:15:02,235 --> 00:15:03,937
this to me.

188
00:15:03,971 --> 00:15:07,140
Ha! That's nothing!
Check me out!

189
00:15:07,174 --> 00:15:11,711
These things are literally
holding me together!

190
00:15:11,744 --> 00:15:13,546
Dude, really?

191
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:19,052
I used to go to the bathroom,
but now I go in a bag!

192
00:15:19,086 --> 00:15:21,288
He busted me eye!

193
00:15:22,189 --> 00:15:26,793
Man...those robotic cats
got nothin' on me!

194
00:15:26,826 --> 00:15:32,332
'Cause back in the day,
I was a bad-ass sa-mu-rai!

195
00:15:32,365 --> 00:15:34,167
I was da' samurai!

196
00:15:37,704 --> 00:15:41,308
I was all about
the slicing and dicing!

197
00:15:41,341 --> 00:15:42,409
Talkin' 'bout the...

198
00:15:43,476 --> 00:15:46,446
Funk-a-chop!

199
00:15:46,479 --> 00:15:48,915
The whack-a-hack!

200
00:15:48,948 --> 00:15:52,352
And, of course,
the ever famous...

201
00:15:52,385 --> 00:15:55,955
turkey carve!

202
00:15:55,989 --> 00:15:58,358
But Samurai Jack enlightened me

203
00:15:58,391 --> 00:16:02,329
to the true meaning
of being a samurai.

204
00:16:02,362 --> 00:16:06,266
Shortly after,
I gave up my blade and top knot

205
00:16:06,299 --> 00:16:11,371
and became the bartender here
at the place where we first met.

206
00:16:11,404 --> 00:16:12,839
Uh...

207
00:16:12,872 --> 00:16:15,108
That doesn't
sound bad at all.

208
00:16:15,142 --> 00:16:18,345
That's because you ain't got
no soul, you robot fool!

209
00:16:18,378 --> 00:16:23,016
I have returned!

210
00:16:25,652 --> 00:16:29,689
I, Demongo,
have come to collect

211
00:16:29,722 --> 00:16:34,194
the souls
of the greatest warriors.

212
00:16:35,928 --> 00:16:42,502
But I see I have come
to the wrong place.

213
00:16:43,170 --> 00:16:44,737
We got
some straight-up freaks

214
00:16:44,771 --> 00:16:46,706
coming through
this place.

215
00:16:53,846 --> 00:16:57,584
