226
00:18:31,211 --> 00:18:35,348
Great warriors of past,
I welcome you.

227
00:18:35,382 --> 00:18:38,918
This samurai has
failed his purpose

228
00:18:38,951 --> 00:18:42,054
and has accepted
his fate.

229
00:19:01,674 --> 00:19:03,810
