you have helped.

237
00:19:20,026 --> 00:19:21,828
You saved them!

238
00:19:21,861 --> 00:19:24,264
Enough!

239
00:19:36,543 --> 00:19:39,479
Hope is just
a fleeting sentiment.

240
00:19:39,512 --> 00:19:42,582
Your failure is real.

241
00:19:42,615 --> 00:19:44,584
You must face the consequences

242
00:19:44,617 --> 00:19:51,190
or continue to bear the guilt of
your dishonor for all eternity.

243
00:19:52,792 --> 00:19:55,762
